description:
X-ray phase-contrast tomography (XPCT) and light sheet fluorescence microscopy (LSFM) datasets of rodent (mouse, rat, gerbil, guinea pig) and non-human primate (common marmoset) cochleae.
Supplementary data for "Multiscale photonic imaging of the native and implanted cochlea" published in PNAS in 2021 (doi: 10.1073/pnas.2014472118).
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

